sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User<br/>(workflow / task page)
  participant P as lib/workflow/<br/>publish-dag.ts
  participant SL as lib/scheduler/serverless/<br/>publish.ts
  participant MW as Regional MWAA Serverless
  participant CMD as bgp-action-commands<br/>(home region)
  participant DL as Dispatcher Lambda<br/>(action-dispatcher)
  participant IN as /api/internal/actions/run
  U->>P: Publish workflow (or enable the schedule<br/>of a sync / job / governance task / card refresh)
  P->>P: buildCarrierArtifact:<br/>DAG definition YAML + code package<br/>
  P->>SL: publishServerlessWorkflow
  SL->>MW: PutObject (DAG bucket) → CreateWorkflow / UpdateWorkflow
  Note over MW: Runs on schedule<br/>node types: sql · python · sync<br/>foreach · branch · join · setvar<br/>external · platform-action
  MW->>CMD: platform-action node ⇒ write command
  CMD->>DL: DynamoDB Stream trigger
  DL->>IN: call the platform's internal endpoint (origin header check)
  IN->>IN: Execute: governance task /<br/>card refresh / sync start<br/>
  IN-->>MW: write back result
  U->>MW: Monitor page: ListWorkflowRuns · GetTaskInstance · GetLogEvents
